stles were among his closest disciples, and he sent them out to preach his teachings.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7630-85f2-3c4b452d0c0c","description":"Jesus","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7f56-a6e7-ea1d7b3d5b43","description":"Muhammad","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-73e7-9f81-1890d1d4e8c1","description":"Buddha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-71a1-b730-16428bd1837f","description":"Moses","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-714e-83ec-81706d7e945f","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of the following describes Charles Darwin?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"In On the Origin of Species, Darwin argued that natural selection helps explain how species change over time.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-70c2-a7c7-040b39afb84f","description":"Scientist who proposed and popularised the theory of evolution.","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7982-b826-27c9b08bd18d","description":"Conquistador who claimed Inca lands for Spain.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7f14-becd-b8a51bdf70f5","description":"Influential Christian saint and writer, who shaped much of Western Christian thought.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7b25-8057-34d504691338","description":"Victoria era novelist who wrote many popular books.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7390-a4e6-4b76745165aa","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What word is used when a candidate receives an overwhelming majority of votes in an election?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"In election coverage, a landslide means a decisive victory by a very large margin, borrowing the image of a powerful mass sweeping downhill.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-744e-b4d7-a0acfc87bfc7","description":"Landslide","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7dee-a33e-9ee814ed6609","description":"Tsunami","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad5f-7e90-b486-8f21c761b98a","d